x; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Our Core Principles</h3>\n                <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.2; color: #334155;\">\n                    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n                        <span style=\"color: #2563eb; font-size: 20px;\">🛡️</span>\n                        <div><strong>Transparency:</strong> Clear timelines, metrics, and honest communication at every step.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n                        <span style=\"color: #2563eb; font-size: 20px;\">📈</span>\n                        <div><strong>Measurable Impact:</strong> Relentless focus on bottom-line financial and operational ROI.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;\">\n                        <span style=\"color: #2563eb; font-size: 20px;\">💡</span>\n                        <div><strong>Continuous Innovation:</strong> Modern cloud architecture and future-proof systems.</div>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n','About','','trash','closed','closed','','about__trashed','','','2026-10-07 09:21:34','2026-10-07 09:21:34','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/index.php/about/',0,'page','',0),(87,1,'2026-10-06 09:16:45','2026-10-06 09:16:45','\n<div class=\"elementor elementor-contact-page\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, sans-serif;\">\n    <section style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; padding: 90px 24px; text-align: center;\">\n        <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n            <h1 style=\"font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">Contact Apex Business Solutions</h1>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;\">Reach out to our executive advisory team to discuss partnerships, projects, and custom solutions.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"background: #ffffff; padding: 80px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px;\">\n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 540px; min-width: 300px; background: #f8fafc; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n                <h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Send Us a Message</h3>\n                <form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); alert(\'Message received! Our team will respond within 24 hours.\');\">\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 14px;\">Full Name</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"Jane Doe\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 14px;\">Business Email</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"jane@enterprise.com\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                        <label style=\"display: block; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 14px;\">Project Scope</label